<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:明早期_纏枝蓮托八寳鳳鳥紋妝花緞-Textile_Panel_with_Phoenixes_and_Lotuses_MET_DP158225.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer">Commons — Met zhuanghua panel</a>。
